  "question": {
    "text": "In the given electromagnetic wave $\\mathrm{E}_{\\mathrm{y}}=600 \\sin (\\omega \\mathrm{t}-\\mathrm{kx}) \\mathrm{Vm}^{-1}$, intensity of the associated light beam is (in $\\mathrm{W} / \\mathrm{m}^2$ : (Given $\\epsilon_0=9 \\times 10^{-12} \\mathrm{C}^2 \\mathrm{~N}^{-1} \\mathrm{~m}^{-2}$ )",
    "image": null
